== Effect ==
* Increases the time that [[status effect]]s stay on enemies.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Further increases the duration of status effect.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Acid Baby}} / {{i|The Bean}} / {{i|The Black Bean}} / {{i|Contagion}}: The [[poison]] duration from these items is not affected by Second Hand.
* {{i|Hemoptysis}}: The Brimstone curse duration is affected by Second Hand. This also applies to {{C|Tainted Azazel}}.
* {{t|Meconium}}: The [[confuse]] duration from {{e|Black Poop}}s is unaffected by Second Hand.
* {{i|Mega Bean}}: Doubles the petrification duration but not the poison duration.
* {{i|2Spooky}} / {{I|Venus}}: The fear/charm effect will last for twice as long after an enemy leaves Isaac's radius.

